  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【宮崎県の温泉完全ガイド】名湯ランキング＆露天風呂付きおすすめ旅館10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">宮崎県が誇る風情ある温泉街や隠れ家温泉リゾート。泉質の特徴や美肌効果、四季折々の絶景を楽しめる露天風呂、地元宮崎県の旬の食材（宮崎県名物料理・地場グルメ）を味わえる極上宿を紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 宮崎県の温泉エリアとおすすめポイント</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-2\">日々の疲れをリフレッシュする天然温泉。カップルの記念日旅行、家族旅行、自分へのご褒美ステイに最適なエリアが揃っています。</p>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-950\">\n    <strong>注目の温泉・宿泊エリア：</strong> 高千穂・青島・日南\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 宮崎県の主要エリア別おすすめ温泉宿</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-amber-500 font-bold\">♨️</span> 高千穂・青島・日南エリアの温泉・宿\n            </h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">宮崎県を代表する観光名所・絶景スポット・名湯が凝縮された一番人気エリア。</p>\n            <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside bg-stone-50 p-3 rounded-xl\"><li><strong>ＦＡＶ　ＬＵＸ　宮崎</strong>（評価 ⭐4.6）</li><li><strong>ＡＮＡホリデイ・インリゾート宮崎　ｂｙ　ＩＨＧ</strong>（評価 ⭐4.6）</li><li><strong>天然温泉　日向の湯　ドーミーイン宮崎（ドーミーイン・御宿野乃　ホテルズグループ）</strong>（評価 ⭐4.6）</li></ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">💡 宮崎県の温泉宿選び＆予約のコツ</h3>\n<ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n  <li><strong>客室露天風呂・貸切風呂：</strong> プライベートな空間で温泉を満喫したいカップル・ファミリーに大人気</li>\n  <li><strong>料理自慢の宿：</strong> 宮崎県ならではの郷土料理やブランド牛、新鮮な山海の幸を堪能できるプランを選択</li>\n  <li><strong>お得な予約タイミング：</strong> 楽天トラベルの「5と0のつく日」や限定クーポンを活用してお得に予約</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設（追加セレクション）</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/67935/67935.jpg\" alt=\"ホテル高千穂\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">ホテル高千穂</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮崎県西臼杵郡高千穂町三田井1037-4 ｜ 熊本ICから南阿蘇経由で１時間半。阿蘇～高千穂周遊もおすすめ！延岡ICから４５分　高千穂峡から徒歩13分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.41（793件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥6,700〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">つい、大自然に声をかけたくなるホテル♪　ひとり旅の女性やお子様連れのご家族も安心して御宿泊できます。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D67935\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/20561/20561.jpg\" alt=\"天然温泉　たかちほの湯　スーパーホテル宮崎天然温泉\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">天然温泉　たかちほの湯　スーパーホテル宮崎天然温泉</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮崎県宮崎市橘通東2-2-6 ｜ ■『宮崎駅』より車で約５分♪■『宮崎空港』よりバスで約２０分『橘通２丁目』下車徒歩１分■　県庁約１分、繁華街まで約5分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.06（2333件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥3,110〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">男女別天然温泉「たかちほの湯」と無料健康朝食付きのビジネスホテル　繁華街【ニシタチ】に近く好立地！</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D20561\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/177729/177729.jpg\" alt=\"天然温泉　ひなたの湯　スーパーホテルＰｒｅｍｉｅｒ宮崎一番街\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">天然温泉　ひなたの湯　スーパーホテルＰｒｅｍｉｅｒ宮崎一番街</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮崎県宮崎市中央通7-18 ｜ 宮崎駅よりお車にて約６分、宮崎空港よりリムジンバスで１本「橘通り３丁目」下車徒歩３分、繁華街へ徒歩０分と好立地</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.43（1039件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥4,450〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">高い顧客満足度と無料サービスが充実！街中でトロトロ美肌の男女別天然温泉とウェルカムBarで寛ぎを。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D177729\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/147117/147117.jpg\" alt=\"妙見温泉　天けい荘\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">妙見温泉　天けい荘</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">鹿児島県霧島市隼人町嘉例川4403 ｜ 児島空港から車で12分  ／路線バス停『立花上』下車すぐ</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 3.5（44件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥8,100〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">自家源泉と渓谷美を誇る隠れ家的湯宿。鹿児島空港利用の前後泊にも便利♪</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D147117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68633/68633.jpg\" alt=\"ベッセルホテル都城\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">ベッセルホテル都城</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮崎県都城市都北町5819-3 ｜ 都城ICより車で約10分。宮崎空港より高速バス都城方面行き乗車、50分で松の元バス停到着、徒歩8分。都城駅より車で10分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.46（2279件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥2,945〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">全室幅１５０センチのクィーンサイズベッドを設置。駐車場、インターネット無料。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D68633\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/28133/28133.jpg\" alt=\"くじゅう高原温泉　レゾネイトクラブくじゅう\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">くじゅう高原温泉　レゾネイトクラブくじゅう</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">大分県竹田市久住町大字有氏字広内1773 ｜ JR豊後竹田駅から約３０分／大分道・日田ＩＣから約９０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.2（694件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥15,540〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">阿蘇くじゅう国立公園の敷地内、標高８６５ｍ���久住高原に佇む自然との共鳴がコンセプトのリゾートホテル。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D28133\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-